WEBVTT

00:11:59.371 --> 00:12:01.204
It's it's fascinating to watch, though,

00:12:01.204 --> 00:12:04.496
because I've seen your eyes
light up and, you know,

00:12:04.496 --> 00:12:08.954
it's it's it's palpable when you when you
discover that you were wrong about

00:12:08.954 --> 00:12:13.662
a hypothesis or a prediction, you look
like you are experiencing joy.

00:12:14.412 --> 00:12:19.954
And I've started to think a lot about what
prevents people from getting to that

00:12:19.954 --> 00:12:23.621
place. And I think a lot of
it is for so many people,

00:12:24.079 --> 00:12:29.246
they get trapped in either a preacher
or a prosecutor mindset of saying,

00:12:29.246 --> 00:12:33.287
you know, I I know my beliefs are correct
or I know other people are wrong.